# PART 6 — THE RAGIMO CONNECTION ENGINE

This is the most important differentiating capability.

Do not build CRM and Tasks as isolated modules.

Build a connected frontend experience where the same business records can be accessed from different workflows.

## 6.1 CRM ↔ Tasks

From any lead, contact, company, or deal, users should be able to:

- Create a task.
- Assign a task.
- Schedule a follow-up.
- View related tasks.
- View completed tasks.
- Track outstanding actions.

From any task, users should be able to:

- Open its related contact.
- Open its related company.
- Open its related deal.
- Open its related project.

## 6.2 CRM ↔ Invoices

Connect CRM records to existing financial capabilities.

A contact should show:
- Total invoiced.
- Paid invoices.
- Outstanding balance.
- Recent invoice activity.

A deal should support:
- Creating an invoice.
- Viewing linked invoices.
- Viewing invoice status.

A company should aggregate related customer financial activity without double-counting.

Never create actual payments or financial transactions automatically.

## 6.3 Tasks ↔ Expenses

Projects should be able to display expenses related to their work.

Show:
- Project expenses.
- Budget.
- Budget consumed.
- Remaining budget.
- Related expense records.

Do not create an expense automatically when a task is completed.

## 6.4 Tasks ↔ CRM follow-ups

A CRM follow-up should be represented by a task or a linked task record.

Avoid duplicate independent records.

For example:

A lead requires a call tomorrow.

The user creates a follow-up.

It appears in:
- Lead detail.
- Activities.
- My Tasks.
- Calendar.
- Tasks Overview.

Completing it should update the associated follow-up state.

## 6.5 Tasks ↔ Raqimo AI

Provide AI entry points in relevant locations.

Examples:

Inside a task:
"Help me break this task into subtasks."

Inside a project:
"Summarize project progress."

Inside CRM:
"Suggest the next best action for this lead."

Inside a deal:
"Identify what is blocking this opportunity."

Inside the dashboard:
"Show me the most important things I should handle today."

For this implementation, build the AI interaction interface and local demo responses only.

Do not pretend that real AI backend operations are connected unless an existing supported integration is available.

